# Sales Data Analysis

 ## Objective
Analyze sales data to uncover trends and improve revenue strategies.

---

##  Dataset
- Order Date
- Region
- Product
- Sales
- Profit

---

## Key Steps
- Data Cleaning
- Handling Missing Values
- Exploratory Data Analysis
- Visualization

---

## Insights
- West region had highest sales
- Technology category most profitable
- Discounts negatively impacted profit

---

##  Tools Used
- Python (Pandas, Matplotlib, Seaborn)

---

##  Output
- Sales trend charts
- Profit analysis graphs
